From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Subject: [PATCH] Add generic Companion App Bridge GATT service

Enables bidirectional communication between AsteroidOS apps and
Android companion apps (such as Gadgetbridge) or third-party Android
apps. Registers org.asteroidos.CompanionGateway on the session bus.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [mio hoki patch]
